      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is 2026-03-24 from 02:00 to 04:00 local time. If the validation checks fail during the patch, the rollback procedure is to use the command `orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>`, which rehydrates the prior rules and replays the cache invalidation hook. After rollback, Verdant Bay must be notified, an incident opened for manual remediation, and any partial replays reverted. This rollback is automatic if any validation fails, and the patch deployment includes pre-patch snapshotting of audit logs and validation jobs with synthetic and in-flight approvals to ensure correctness before release [art_fff67d92fe41, art_f893faeda15a].",
