      "answer": "The customer most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if the next promised milestone is missed is Pioneer Freight Solutions. They are currently running a tactical PoC of NoiseGuard, a lower-cost competitor positioned for quick tactical noise reduction but lacking deeper schema-aware enrichment and automation capabilities. The exact milestone at risk is the acceptance of the remediation plan for taxonomy change issues, specifically the backfill and shadow-index validation steps, with acceptance criteria including precision@10 >= 0.8 for facility lookups and entity-link hit rate >= 90%, targeted for completion by mid-May 2026. Missing this milestone increases the risk that Pioneer Freight will extend NoiseGuard usage and reduce scope with Northstar, as NoiseGuard is cheaper and addresses immediate tactical needs. This milestone is part of a multi-step remediation plan agreed on 2026-03-18, with key dates including schema registry verification by 2026-03-22, shadow index build by 2026-04-09, backfill and recompute index weights by 2026-04-30, and validation window ending 2026-05-14 [art_7373b64fdfdd, art_ac8afb52f2d3, art_e2727db588de].",
